# S11 Tiberian Dawn, first Nod mission (SCB01EA, desert): desert ground, mottle and the
# desert decal set. Frames the village and the Nod start at tick 1 and tick 300, then
# destroys two village houses (explosions, craters, wrecks) and frames them again.
game: td
scen: SCB01EA
modes: enh,cls,n64
---
gfxload {CFG}
gfx show_stats 0
